      "content": "i spent my whole life thinking i was going to be someone. like, actually significant. but i just hit this wall. i can see the gap between where i am and where the real geniuses are, and it's massive. i'm just... mediocre. and honestly, being mediocre feels like a slow death. it feels pointless to even keep going if you're just gonna be background noise.",
