      "content": "\"it's time to walk away\"... that's exactly it. but \"walking away\" is so vague. i don't mean just quitting my job or moving to a new city. i mean walking away from the whole thing. if the life i planned is dead, then what's left to actually live? it feels like the only way to stop the performance is to just exit the stage entirely. do you think there's any actual dignity in that, or is it just cowardice?",
